<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>에스알커머스 박동후 명함</title>
    <!-- Fonts: Pretendard (Korean) & Google Fonts (Cinzel, Outfit) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard-dynamic-subset.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700;900&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@3.5.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-navy: #1A2E5A;
            --accent-gold: #C5A880; /* Elegant gold accent */
            --text-dark: #1E293B;
            --text-light: #64748B;
            --card-width: 440px;
            --card-height: 244px; /* Exact standard proportions */
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f7ff;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, hsla(215, 100%, 93%, 1) 0px, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(at 100% 0%, hsla(220, 100%, 96%, 1) 0px, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(at 100% 100%, hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 1) 0px, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(at 0% 100%, hsla(210, 100%, 94%, 1) 0px, transparent 50%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        /* Side-by-side wrapper */
        .card-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .business-card {
            width: var(--card-width);
            height: var(--card-height);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Front: Deep Navy & Gold Line */
        .card-front {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A2E5A 0%, #0F172A 100%);
            color: white;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .logo-wrap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: white;
            width: 76px;
            height: 76px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            padding: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }

        .logo-img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .company-name {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .company-sub {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: -6px;
        }

        /* Back: White & Navy/Gold Details */
        .card-back {
            padding: 28px;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: white;
        }

        /* Gold side accent border */
        .card-back::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 5px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .card-back-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .profile-info h2 {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-navy);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .profile-info .title {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1a365d;
            background: #ebf8ff; /* Soft premium blue badge */
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: inline-block;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .back-logo {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
            padding: 4px;
        }

        .back-logo img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .contact-details {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .contact-item i {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            width: 18px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .card-back-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
            border-top: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
            padding-top: 8px;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .footer-company {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-navy);
        }

        /* Responsive styling */
        @media (max-width: 950px) {
            .card-wrapper {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 20px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            :root {
                --card-width: 90vw;
                --card-height: calc(90vw * 0.5545);
            }
            .profile-info h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; }
            .profile-info .title { font-size: 0.72rem; }
            .contact-item { font-size: 0.7rem; }
            .company-name { font-size: 1.3rem; }
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .card-wrapper {
                gap: 20mm;
            }
            .business-card {
                box-shadow: none !important;
                border: 1px solid #CBD5E1 !important;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card-wrapper">
        <!-- FRONT SIDE -->
        <div class="business-card card-front">
            <div class="logo-wrap">
                <img src="sr_logo.webp" alt="에스알커머스 로고" class="logo-img">
            </div>
            <div class="company-name">에스알커머스</div>
            <div class="company-sub">SR Commerce</div>
        </div>

        <!-- BACK SIDE -->
        <div class="business-card card-back">
            <div class="card-back-header">
                <div class="profile-info">
                    <h2>박 동 후</h2>
                    <span class="title">웹개발 기획담당 팀장</span>
                </div>
                <div class="back-logo">
                    <img src="sr_logo.webp" alt="로고">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-details">
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="ri-phone-fill"></i>
                    <span>010-2371-9277</span>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="ri-mail-fill"></i>
                    <span>guffyd321@naver.com</span>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="ri-map-pin-fill"></i>
                    <span>부산광역시 부산진구 동천로 116 한신밴빌딩 1003호</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card-back-footer">
                <span class="footer-company">에스알커머스</span>
                <span style="font-family: 'Cinzel'; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--accent-gold);">SR Commerce</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
